    "markdown2 150:70 call  sha256(SECRET_SALT + s.encode(\"utf-8\")).hexdigest()": [
      "The public hashlib.sha256 factory uses _hashlib.HASH with OpenSSL, or the builtin fallback without _hashlib/its algorithm. Supported CPython 3.9 and 3.11 define the fallback receiver as _sha256.sha256; 3.12 defines _sha2.SHA256Type. These concrete classes have no public hashlib class alias. Retained primary hashlib and C type/factory/hexdigest sources establish all three receivers."
    ],
    "markdown2 183:19 call  fp.read()": [
      "codecs.open with an encoding (a str, by the annotation of markdown_path) returns a codecs.StreamReaderWriter"
    ],
    "markdown2 184:13 call  fp.close()": [
      "codecs.StreamReaderWriter defines no close; its __getattr__ returns the close of its stream, the file that codecs.open opens in binary mode ('rb', an io.BufferedReader)"
    ],
